#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="swift-ios"
DISPLAY_NAME="Swift / iOS"

DESCRIPTION:
Native iOS (and optionally macOS) apps in Swift. SwiftUI-first but
UIKit patterns documented as needed.

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      Swift 5.10+ (Xcode-managed)
- Build:         xcodebuild or swift build (SPM)
- Test:          XCTest + swift test / xcodebuild test
- Lint:          SwiftLint
- Format:        swift-format
- Dependency:    Swift Package Manager (SPM) preferred over CocoaPods

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.chloeai → .claude/rules/code.chloeai
- init-project.sh copies tests.chloeai → .claude/rules/tests.chloeai
- Fill in Xcode version and iOS deployment target before first session
